'''Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS''' (超古代勇者ウルトラソウルズ, ''chō kodai yūsha urutora souruzu'', '''Super Ancient Heroes Ultra Souls''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats, characters based on Japanese mythologies. This event was added since February 28th, 2015 in [[The Battle Cats]]. These cats are all anti-Angels who are cheap and spammable in their Normal Form and expensive, but high-performance in Evolved and True Forms.

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the player needs to beat [[India (Into the Future)|India]] in the '''Japanese''' and '''International''' versions and [[Easter Island (Empire of Cats)|Easter Island]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' version.

