==Trivia==
*The cats in this series combine folk (for Normal Form) and modern (Evolved and [[True Form]]s) references for each character.
**[[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Angels]] are based on [[wikipedia:Momotarō|Momotarō]] and a war buggy, rather than a specific story.
**[[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Guardian Gamereon]] is based on [[wikipedia:Urashima Tarō|Urashima Tarō]] and [[wikipedia:Gamera|Gamera]].
**[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Super Galaxy Cosmo]] is based on [[wikipedia:Tsuru no Ongaeshi|Tsuru no Ongaeshi]] and [[wikipedia:Saint Seiya|Saint Seiya]].
**[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Moving Castle]] is based on [[wikipedia:Kasa Jizō|Kasa Jizō]] and the film [[wikipedia:Howl's Moving Castle (film)|Howl's Moving Castle]].
**[[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|The Death Moon]] is based based on [[wikipedia:The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter|Taketori Monogatari]] and the [[wikia:starwars:Death Star|Death Star]].
**[[Kachi-Kachi (Uber Rare Cat)|Fire Squad Kachiyama]] is based on [[wikipedia:Kachi-kachi Yama|Kachi-Kachi Yama]] and Firefighters, rather than a story.
**[[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Rock Revengers]] are based on [[wikipedia:The Crab and the Monkey|Saru-Kani]] and the rock band [[wikipedia:Kiss (band)|Kiss]].
**[[Kintaro (Uber Rare Cat)|Kinrangers RoboForce]] are based on [[wikipedia:Kintarō|Kintarō]] and the [[wikipedia:Super Sentai|Super Sentai]] series.
**[[Shitakiri Sparrow (Uber Rare Cat)|Chunchun Haunters]] are based on [[wikipedia:Shita-kiri Suzume|Shita-kiri Suzume]] and the [[wikipedia:Ghostbusters|Ghostbusters]] film.
**[[Issun Boshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Landshaker Kozuchimaru]] is based on [[wikipedia:Issun-bōshi|Issun-bōshi]] and the [https://www.uboatworx.com/model/c-explorer C-explorer 3] submersible.
**[[Hanasaka Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ravenous Cherry]] is based on [[wikipedia:Hanasaka Jiisan|Hanasaka Jiisan]] and [https://wikizilla.org/wiki/Biollante Biollante Flower Beast Form] from the [[wikipedia:Godzilla (franchise)|Godzilla]] franchise.
**[[Ushiwakamaru (Legend Rare Cat)|Colossal Benkei]] is based on [[wikipedia:Minamoto no Yoshitsune|Minamoto no Yoshitsune]] and the [[wikipedia:Giant Robo|Giant Robo]] series.
*This was the first Uber Rare Set to introduce a 7th unit.

